WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:06.194
Emmy loved the girl group Purple Plaid.

2
00:00:06.195 --> 00:00:11.994
Her friends Kate and Mia loved the singers too.

3
00:00:11.995 --> 00:00:17.203
Now Mom was driving Kate and Emmy to karaoke.

4
00:00:17.204 --> 00:00:22.457
"Mia is meeting us there," Emmy said.

5
00:00:22.458 --> 00:00:27.680
"I can't wait to try karaoke!" Kate said.

6
00:00:27.681 --> 00:00:36.781
Kate's phone pinged. "Oh no! Mia is sick!"

7
00:00:36.782 --> 00:00:44.906
Emmy groaned. "We need her for karaoke!"

8
00:00:44.907 --> 00:00:49.832
"You can still sing," Mom said.

9
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:58.493
"No, there are three girls in Purple Plaid." Emmy sighed.

10
00:00:58.494 --> 00:01:01.974
"Forget about karaoke.

11
00:01:01.975 --> 00:01:05.125
Let's just go home."

12
00:01:05.126 --> 00:01:08.628
Mom pulled into a parking spot.

13
00:01:08.629 --> 00:01:12.104
"But we're already here."

14
00:01:12.105 --> 00:01:17.338
"And I want to try karaoke," Kate said.

15
00:01:17.339 --> 00:01:23.306
Emmy shook her head. "We need Mia."

16
00:01:23.307 --> 00:01:26.422
Suddenly Mom turned around.

17
00:01:26.423 --> 00:01:31.378
"What if I took Mia's place?"

18
00:01:31.379 --> 00:01:35.771
Emmy laughed. "Oh, Mom.

19
00:01:35.772 --> 00:01:38.454
You don't know the music."

20
00:01:38.455 --> 00:01:45.136
"'Strong girls are brave girls are smart girls,'" Mom sang.

21
00:01:45.137 --> 00:01:50.916
Emmy gasped. "How do you know that song?"

22
00:01:50.917 --> 00:01:58.017
"You practice it all the time!" Mom said.

23
00:01:58.018 --> 00:02:08.280
Inside they sat and watched other groups perform.

24
00:02:08.281 --> 00:02:15.983
Emmy suddenly got stage fright. "I can't do this!"

25
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:20.799
But Kate stood up. "I'm doing karaoke.

26
00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:23.467
Ready, Mrs. Carter?"

27
00:02:23.468 --> 00:02:27.026
Mom sang softly in Emmy's ear.

28
00:02:27.027 --> 00:02:32.570
"'Strong girls are brave girls are smart girls.'"

29
00:02:32.571 --> 00:02:38.049
Emmy sang the next line. "'I'm all three.'"

30
00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:41.071
She took a big breath.

31
00:02:41.072 --> 00:03:07.625
"And I'm ready for karaoke!"

